The quickest way, and easiest for uncursing batches of stuff is to...

Hold everything you want uncursed, use a scroll of remove curse (MUST be
uncursed!!) and dip it into a blessed holy water. Then read your scroll in
its blessed form, and voila, everything is cool again (Note: drop your
cursed tp scrolls first). You only need one uncursed scroll of rem.curse and
only one blessed holy water.




